			"Date": "2026-05-16T21:43:57Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1138,
				77
			],
			"Message": "perf(Cocoon): Eliminate dead code in production bundles and optimize bootstrap\n\nEnable tree shaking in production ESBuild configuration and switch the base config to conditionally disable debug logging and metafile generation based on the environment. This significantly reduces bundle size by removing unused exports and non-essential diagnostics.\n\nStreamline the bootstrap logic in `Main.ts` by removing redundant comments and refining the parent PID watchdog to poll every 5s (from 2s) with an `unref` interval to prevent event loop retention. Update `Effect/Bootstrap.ts` with exponential backoff for Mountain connection probes (200ms → 1s cap) and increase timeouts to handle slower startup scenarios.\n\nDrastically optimize `Services/Performance/Monitoring/Service.ts` by converting it to a zero-overhead shim. The previous 741-line implementation shipped dead scaffolding and dynamic imports; the new version retains the interface for compatibility while performing no runtime work, directing users to the Effect-TS Telemetry service for actual metrics. Remove deprecated legacy methods from `Module/Interceptor.ts` and unused `match` logic from `VscodeAPI/Languages/Namespace.ts`. Refactor `Mountain/Client.ts` to use O(1) Exponential Moving Average (EMA) for latency tracking instead of array reductions.\n\nRebuild all `Target/` artifacts, resulting in a ~10% reduction in total bundle size (Main.js: 1.49MB → 1.33MB).",
			"SHA": "444a732deed23d6155be1225a5e8c0e44b5b64cd"
		}
